=1.5224e-03, J2=1.9876e-03, sigma_max= 10.27 MPa\n"," Sample 350 | J1=2.5689e-03, J2=1.9114e-03, sigma_max= 18.04 MPa\n"," Sample 375 | J1=1.6253e-03, J2=1.3096e-03, sigma_max= 14.67 MPa\n"," Sample 400 | J1=2.9378e-03, J2=2.3484e-03, sigma_max= 20.95 MPa\n"," Sample 425 | J1=1.4447e-03, J2=1.8854e-03, sigma_max= 10.14 MPa\n"," Sample 450 | J1=2.0012e-03, J2=2.3910e-03, sigma_max=  8.49 MPa\n"," Sample 475 | J1=1.1767e-03, J2=1.3934e-03, sigma_max= 13.40 MPa\n"," Sample 500 | J1=1.7137e-03, J2=2.0515e-03, sigma_max=  9.18 MPa\n","\n","Collected 500 valid samples out of 500 attempts.\n","\n","=== 4. Training surrogate NN ===\n","  Epoch    0, loss = 1.035e+00\n","  Epoch  150, loss = 1.236e-01\n","  Epoch  300, loss = 5.329e-02\n","  Epoch  450, loss = 3.794e-02\n","  Epoch  600, loss = 2.925e-02\n","  Epoch  750, loss = 2.200e-02\n","  Epoch  900, loss = 1.794e-02\n","  Epoch  999, loss = 1.602e-02\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 600x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","TRAIN RMSE:\n","  J_shape   : 5.5106e-04\n","  sigma_max : 0.431 MPa\n","TRAIN R^2:\n","  J_shape   : 0.9729\n","  sigma_max : 0.9950\n","\n","TEST RMSE:\n","  J_shape   : 1.3231e-03\n","  sigma_max : 0.828 MPa\n","TEST R^2:\n","  J_shape   : 0.8774\n","  sigma_max : 0.9792\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 500x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 500x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 500x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 500x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","=== 5. Gradient-based design optimization (UNIFORM thickness) ===\n","  [restart 0] Step   0 | Jshape=2.8740e-03, sigma= 11.66 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step  50 | Jshape=2.1252e-03, sigma= 14.78 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 100 | Jshape=2.1344e-03, sigma= 14.84 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 150 | Jshape=2.1357e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 200 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 250 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 300 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 350 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 400 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 450 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 500 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 550 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 600 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 650 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 700 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 750 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 800 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 850 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 900 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 950 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","  [restart 0] Step 999 | Jshape=2.1356e-03, sigma= 14.85 MPa\n","\n","  Best surrogate J after 5 restarts: -5.3418e-03\n","  FEM refinement start: J_true=2.7698e-03, Jshape=2.2137e-03, sigma_max= 12.90 MPa\n","  FEM refinement end  : J_true=2.4091e-03, Jshape=2.0317e-03, sigma_max= 14.52 MPa\n","\n","Uniform flex-strip thickness (skin) ≈ 2.059 mm\n","Rib locations (as % chord):\n","  Rib 1 @ 82.3% c\n","  Rib 2 @ 75.0% c\n","  Rib 3 @ 77.8% c\n","  Rib 4 @ 95.0% c\n","\n","=== 6. Thickness sweep at fixed optimal rib locations (true FEM) ===\n","  Min J_shape (true FEM sweep) at t ≈ 2.045 mm (t_norm ≈ 0.182), sigma_max ≈  14.65 MPa\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 600x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 600x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","=== 6. Full FEM validation of optimized design (both modes, with aero) ===\n","  Mode 1 (-1°):  J_shape = 9.2201e-04, sigma_max =  10.17 MPa\n","  Mode 2 (-5°):  J_shape = 1.1097e-03, sigma_max =  14.52 MPa\n","  Combined J    = 2.0317e-03\n","  Max sigma     =  14.52 MPa (yield 42.0 MPa)\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x400 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":["\"\"\"\n","Morphing Trailing Edge – 2-Mode Optimization with Aerodynamic Loads\n","===================================================================\n","\n","Now with:\n","  - XFOIL geometry + Cp-based pressure loads\n","  - Robust shape-error calculation (no NaNs killing the dataset)\n","  - Training loss curve for the surrogate NN\n","  - Fallback to actuator-only case if aero causes 0 valid samples\n","  - Actuator stroke calibration from XFOIL target shapes\n","  - NEW: consistent scaling with chord length (thickness + actuator strokes)\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 0. IMPORTS\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","import numpy as np\n","import scipy.sparse as sp\n","import scipy.sparse.linalg as spla\n","from scipy.interpolate import Akima1DInterpolator\n","from scipy.integrate import trapezoid\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import pandas as pd\n","\n","import torch\n","import torch.nn as nn\n","import torch.optim as optim\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 1. CONFIGURATION\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","class Config:\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # Material / geometry\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    E = 2.34e9              # Young's modulus [Pa]\n","\n","    # Current working chord/span of the test article\n","    CHORD = 1.0             # [m] *physical* chord you want to simulate\n","    SPAN = 1.0              # [m] out-of-plane width (per unit span is fine)\n","\n","    # Reference chord length that all original dimensional numbers were tuned for.\n","    # This should be the \"old\" chord of your previous working script.\n","    CHORD_REF = 0.30        # [m] original reference chord (adjust if needed)\n","\n","    YIELD_STRESS = 42e6     # [Pa] yield stress (≈ 42 MPa)\n","\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # Reference flex-strip thickness bounds, for CHORD_REF\n","    # (these were 1.5–4.5mm at the old chord)\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    T_REF_BOUNDS = (0.00045, 0.00135)  # [m]\n","\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # Reference actuator strokes for CHORD_REF.\n","    # These are absolute displacements (meters) for the original chord.\n","    # They get scaled with chord and then overridden by calibration.\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    ACTUATOR_MODE1_REF = -0.004   # [m]  -4 mm   → roughly -1° flap at CHORD_REF\n","    ACTUATOR_MODE2_REF = -0.005   # [m]  -5 mm   → roughly -5° flap at CHORD_REF\n","\n","    # Reference search ranges used in calibration (for CHORD_REF)\n","    ACT_RANGE1_REF = (-0.003, 0.003)   # [-3 mm, 3] for Mode 1\n","    ACT_RANGE2_REF = (-0.003, 0.003)   # [-3 mm, 3] for Mode 2\n","\n","    # Runtime values used by the solver (start as scaled defaults, then calibrated)\n","    ACTUATOR_MODE1 = None\n","    ACTUATOR_MODE2 = None\n","\n","    # Where morphing section starts (e.g. 0.7 c)\n","    MORPH_START = 0.7          # non-dimensional\n","\n","    # XFOIL geometry + Cp data files (your isolated sheets)\n","    FLAP_PATH_MODE1 = r\"XFOIL Climb Data (Mode 2).xlsx\"   # −1° flap (Mode 1)\n","    FLAP_SHEET_MODE1 = \"polar -1 deg flap climb\"\n","\n","    FLAP_PATH_MODE2 = r\"XFOIL Cruise Data (Mode 1).xlsx\"  # −5° flap (Mode 2)\n","    FLAP_SHEET_MODE2 = \"-5 deg flap\"\n","\n","    # Aerodynamic conditions (tuned to your climb/cruise)\n","    RHO_MODE1 = 0.344         # [kg/m^3] climb\n","    RHO_MODE2 = 0.653         # [kg/m^3] cruise\n","    V_MODE1 = 230.1           # [m/s] climb\n","    V_MODE2 = 144.04          # [m/s] cruise\n","\n","    # Extra scaling of aero loads to make structural effect visible\n","    AERO_SCALE = 1.0\n","\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # Helper scaling APIs\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    @classmethod\n","    def chord_scale(cls):\n","        \"\"\"Scale factor CHORD / CHORD_REF.\"\"\"\n","        return cls.CHORD / cls.CHORD_REF\n","\n","    @classmethod\n","    def get_thickness_bounds(cls):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Return physical thickness bounds for the *current* chord, scaled so that\n","        t/c is preserved relative to the reference case.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        s = cls.chord_scale()\n","        t_min_ref, t_max_ref = cls.T_REF_BOUNDS\n","        return t_min_ref * s, t_max_ref * s\n","\n","    @classmethod\n","    def init_scaled_defaults(cls):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Initialize ACTUATOR_MODE1/2 by scaling the reference strokes with chord.\n","        This is called once at the start; calibration may overwrite them.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        s = cls.chord_scale()\n","        cls.ACTUATOR_MODE1 = cls.ACTUATOR_MODE1_REF * s\n","        cls.ACTUATOR_MODE2 = cls.ACTUATOR_MODE2_REF * s\n","\n","    @classmethod\n","    def get_actuator_search_ranges(cls):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Return (u1_min, u1_max, u2_min, u2_max) scaled with chord, so u/c is\n","        preserved relative to the reference case.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        s = cls.chord_scale()\n","        u1_min_ref, u1_max_ref = cls.ACT_RANGE1_REF\n","        u2_min_ref, u2_max_ref = cls.ACT_RANGE2_REF\n","        return (\n","            u1_min_ref * s,\n","            u1_max_ref * s,\n","            u2_min_ref * s,\n","            u2_max_ref * s,\n","        )\n","\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # Dynamic pressure helpers\n","    # -------------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    @classmethod\n","    def q_mode1(cls):\n","        return 0.5 * cls.RHO_MODE1 * cls.V_MODE1**2\n","\n","    @classmethod\n","    def q_mode2(cls):\n","        return 0.5 * cls.RHO_MODE2 * cls.V_MODE2**2\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 2. GEOMETRY: NACA 2412 + SIMPLE SKELETON MESH\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","class WingGeometry:\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Builds:\n","      - NACA 2412 reference airfoil (outer shape)\n","      - Inner beam skeleton (upper/lower strips + 4 ribs)\n","        for a *given* flex-strip thickness and rib locations.\n","\n","    Design variables (normalized in [0,1]):\n","        t_norm       → uniform thickness t ∈ [t_min, t_max]\n","        rib1_param   → rib 1 in [0.70c, 0.80c]\n","        rib2_param   → rib 2 in [0.80c, 0.88c]\n","        rib3_param   → rib 3 in [0.88c, 0.94c]\n","        rib4_param   → rib 4 in [0.94c, 0.99c]\n","\n","    All ribs are inside the morphing region (MORPH_START = 0.7).\n","    \"\"\"\n","\n","    def __init__(self, naca_code=(2, 4, 12)):\n","        # Decode NACA 2412: m = camber, p = location, t = thickness\n","        self.m = naca_code[0] / 100.0\n","        self.p = naca_code[1] / 10.0\n","        self.t = naca_code[2] / 100.0\n","\n","        # Baseline x-coordinates (outer airfoil)\n","        self.x_base = np.linspace(0.0, Config.CHORD, 400)\n","        x_c = self.x_base / Config.CHORD\n","\n","        # Mean camber line yc(x)\n","        yc = np.zeros_like(self.x_base)\n","        mask1 = x_c < self.p\n","        mask2 = ~mask1\n","        yc[mask1] = (self.m / self.p**2) * (2 * self.p * x_c[mask1] - x_c[mask1]**2)\n","        yc[mask2] = (self.m / (1 - self.p)**2) * (\n","            (1 - 2 * self.p) + 2 * self.p * x_c[mask2] - x_c[mask2]**2\n","        )\n","        yc *= Config.CHORD\n","\n","        # Thickness distribution yt(x)\n","        yt = 5 * self.t * Config.CHORD * (\n","            0.2969 * np.sqrt(x_c)\n","            - 0.1260 * x_c\n","            - 0.3516 * x_c**2\n","            + 0.2843 * x_c**3\n","            - 0.1015 * x_c**4\n","        )\n","\n","        # Local slope of camber line\n","        dyc_dx = np.gradient(yc, self.x_base)\n","        theta = np.arctan(dyc_dx)\n","\n","        # Outer upper and lower surfaces of the airfoil\n","        self.xu = self.x_base - yt * np.sin(theta)\n","        self.yu = yc + yt * np.cos(theta)\n","        self.xl = self.x_base + yt * np.sin(theta)\n","        self.yl = yc - yt * np.cos(theta)\n","\n","    def generate_mesh(self, t_skin,\n","                      rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Build the inner beam skeleton:\n","\n","          - upper strip (inner upper skin)\n","          - lower strip (inner lower skin)\n","          - 4 vertical ribs at rib1_x ... rib4_x\n","\n","        All rib*_param are in [0,1], mapped to chord fractions that live fully\n","        in [MORPH_START, 1.0].\n","        \"\"\"\n","        # ----- Rib positions along the chord (fractions) -----\n","        rib1_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib1_param   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","        rib2_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib2_param   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","        rib3_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib3_param   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","        rib4_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib4_param   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","\n","        rib_x_list = [\n","            rib1_frac * Config.CHORD,\n","            rib2_frac * Config.CHORD,\n","            rib3_frac * Config.CHORD,\n","            rib4_frac * Config.CHORD,\n","        ]\n","\n","        # Nodes only in morphing region\n","        x_start = Config.MORPH_START * Config.CHORD\n","\n","        # Increase resolution in morph region\n","        # finer mesh for better curvature, negligible effect on results\n","        # does not change design space\n","        # gets smoother interpolation in compute_shape_error and more flexibility\n","        # in how bending distributes between ribs\n","        N_nodes_chord = 1000\n","        x_mesh = np.linspace(x_start, Config.CHORD, N_nodes_chord)\n","\n","        # Interpolate baseline upper/lower outer surfaces\n","        yu_mesh = np.interp(x_mesh, self.xu, self.yu)\n","        yl_mesh = np.interp(x_mesh, self.xl, self.yl)\n","\n","        # Inner upper/lower strips: offset half thickness\n","        nodes_u = np.column_stack([x_mesh, yu_mesh - t_skin / 2.0])\n","        nodes_l = np.column_stack([x_mesh, yl_mesh + t_skin / 2.0])\n","\n","        # Start assembling node list and element list\n","        all_nodes = list(nodes_u) + list(nodes_l)\n","        elems = []\n","        t_elems = []\n","\n","        # ---- Strip elements (upper and lower) ----\n","        for i in range(N_nodes_chord - 1):\n","            elems.append([i, i + 1])          # upper strip\n","            t_elems.append(t_skin)\n","\n","        offset = N_nodes_chord\n","        for i in range(N_nodes_chord - 1):\n","            elems.append([offset + i, offset + i + 1])   # lower strip\n","            t_elems.append(t_skin)\n","\n","        # ---- Ribs (vertical-ish links between upper and lower strips) ----\n","        for x_loc in rib_x_list:\n","            idx_u = int(np.argmin(np.abs(nodes_u[:, 0] - x_loc)))\n","            idx_l = int(np.argmin(np.abs(nodes_l[:, 0] - x_loc))) + offset\n","\n","            p_top = np.array(all_nodes[idx_u])\n","            p_bot = np.array(all_nodes[idx_l])\n","            mid_point = 0.5 * (p_top + p_bot)\n","            mid_idx = len(all_nodes)\n","            all_nodes.append(mid_point)\n","\n","            # Two beam elements: top–mid and mid–bottom\n","            elems.append([idx_u, mid_idx])\n","            elems.append([mid_idx, idx_l])\n","            t_elems.append(t_skin)\n","            t_elems.append(t_skin)\n","\n","        nodes = np.array(all_nodes, dtype=float)\n","        elems = np.array(elems, dtype=int)\n","        t_elems = np.array(t_elems, dtype=float)\n","\n","        # Indices for boundary conditions and shape error\n","        idx_upper_root = int(np.argmin(np.abs(nodes_u[:, 0] - x_start)))\n","        idx_lower_root = int(np.argmin(np.abs(nodes_l[:, 0] - x_start))) + offset\n","\n","        info = dict(\n","            idx_upper_root=idx_upper_root,\n","            idx_lower_root=idx_lower_root,\n","            N_nodes_chord=N_nodes_chord,\n","            rib1_x=rib_x_list[0],\n","            rib2_x=rib_x_list[1],\n","            rib3_x=rib_x_list[2],\n","            rib4_x=rib_x_list[3],\n","        )\n","\n","        return nodes, elems, t_elems, info\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 3. FEM SOLVER (2D FRAME ELEMENTS)\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","class FEMSolver:\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Very simple 2D Euler–Bernoulli frame FEM:\n","        - 3 DOFs per node: [u, v, theta]\n","        - each element is a 2-node beam\n","    \"\"\"\n","\n","    def beam_stiffness(self, p1, p2, t):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Local 6x6 beam stiffness (in global coords) between p1 and p2.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        dx, dy = p2 - p1\n","        L = np.hypot(dx, dy)\n","        if L < 1e-10:\n","            return np.zeros((6, 6))\n","\n","        c, s = dx / L, dy / L\n","        b = Config.SPAN\n","        A = b * t\n","        I = b * t**3 / 12.0\n","        E = Config.E\n","\n","        k = np.zeros((6, 6))\n","\n","        # ---- axial part ----\n","        k[0, 0] = E * A / L\n","        k[0, 3] = -E * A / L\n","        k[3, 0] = -E * A / L\n","        k[3, 3] = E * A / L\n","\n","        # ---- bending part ----\n","        k[1, 1] = 12 * E * I / L**3\n","        k[1, 2] = 6 * E * I / L**2\n","        k[1, 4] = -12 * E * I / L**3\n","        k[1, 5] = 6 * E * I / L**2\n","\n","        k[2, 2] = 4 * E * I / L\n","        k[2, 4] = -6 * E * I / L**2\n","        k[2, 5] = 2 * E * I / L\n","\n","        k[4, 4] = 12 * E * I / L**3\n","        k[4, 5] = -6 * E * I / L**2\n","\n","        k[5, 5] = 4 * E * I / L\n","\n","        # Fill symmetry\n","        k[2, 1] = k[1, 2]\n","        k[4, 1] = k[1, 4]\n","        k[5, 1] = k[1, 5]\n","        k[4, 2] = k[2, 4]\n","        k[5, 2] = k[2, 5]\n","        k[5, 4] = k[4, 5]\n","\n","        # Rotation matrix from local → global\n","        m = np.array([[c, s, 0.0],\n","                      [-s, c, 0.0],\n","                      [0.0, 0.0, 1.0]])\n","        R = np.zeros((6, 6))\n","        R[0:3, 0:3] = m\n","        R[3:6, 3:6] = m\n","\n","        return R.T @ k @ R\n","\n","    def get_stress(self, p1, p2, t, u_global):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Compute axial + bending stress at outer fiber of the element.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        dx, dy = p2 - p1\n","        L = np.hypot(dx, dy)\n","        if L < 1e-10:\n","            return 0.0\n","\n","        c, s = dx / L, dy / L\n","        m = np.array([[c, s, 0.0],\n","                      [-s, c, 0.0],\n","                      [0.0, 0.0, 1.0]])\n","        R = np.zeros((6, 6))\n","        R[0:3, 0:3] = m\n","        R[3:6, 3:6] = m\n","\n","        # Transform DOFs to local coords\n","        u_loc = R @ u_global\n","        u1, v1, th1, u2, v2, th2 = u_loc\n","\n","        # Axial strain + curvature\n","        strain_ax = (u2 - u1) / L\n","        curvature = (th2 - th1) / L\n","\n","        sigma = Config.E * (strain_ax + (t / 2.0) * curvature)\n","        return abs(sigma)\n","\n","    def build_aero_load_vector(self, nodes, info, cp_u_func, cp_l_func, q_inf):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Build a nodal load vector F_aero (size ndof) from Cp(x) distributions.\n","\n","        p_upper(x) = q_inf * Cp_upper(x)\n","        p_lower(x) = q_inf * Cp_lower(x)\n","        Δp(x)      = p_lower - p_upper   (positive = net upward pressure)\n","\n","        We apply a vertical distributed load:\n","          w(x) = Δp(x) * SPAN * AERO_SCALE\n","\n","        and lump it equally to upper/lower nodes in each chordwise segment.\n","        \"\"\"\n","        N = info[\"N_nodes_chord\"]\n","        offset = N\n","        n_nodes = nodes.shape[0]\n","        F = np.zeros(n_nodes * 3)\n","\n","        for i in range(N - 1):\n","            x1 = nodes[i, 0]\n","            x2 = nodes[i + 1, 0]\n","            xc = 0.5 * (x1 + x2)\n","            dx = x2 - x1\n","\n","            cp_u = float(cp_u_func(xc))\n","            cp_l = float(cp_l_func(xc))\n","\n","            if not np.isfinite(cp_u) or not np.isfinite(cp_l):\n","                continue\n","\n","            dp = Config.AERO_SCALE * q_inf * (cp_l - cp_u)\n","            w = dp * Config.SPAN       # [N/m]\n","            F_seg = w * dx             # [N]\n","\n","            # Take downward as negative y\n","            Fy = -F_seg\n","            share = Fy / 4.0\n","            for nid in (i, i + 1, offset + i, offset + i + 1):\n","                F[3 * nid + 1] += share\n","\n","        return F\n","\n","    def solve(self, nodes, elems, t_elems, actuator_disp, info, F_ext=None):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        Assemble K and F, apply BCs via penalty, and solve Ku = F.\n","\n","        F_ext: optional external nodal load vector (same size as global DOFs).\n","        \"\"\"\n","        n_nodes = nodes.shape[0]\n","        ndof = n_nodes * 3\n","\n","        rows, cols, vals = [], [], []\n","\n","        # ---- assemble global K ----\n","        for i, el in enumerate(elems):\n","            n1, n2 = int(el[0]), int(el[1])\n","            p1 = nodes[n1]\n","            p2 = nodes[n2]\n","            t = t_elems[i]\n","\n","            k_loc = self.beam_stiffness(p1, p2, t)\n","\n","            dofs = [3 * n1, 3 * n1 + 1, 3 * n1 + 2,\n","                    3 * n2, 3 * n2 + 1, 3 * n2 + 2]\n","\n","            for r in range(6):\n","                for c in range(6):\n","                    rows.append(dofs[r])\n","                    cols.append(dofs[c])\n","                    vals.append(k_loc[r, c])\n","\n","        K = sp.coo_matrix((vals, (rows, cols)), shape=(ndof, ndof)).tocsc()\n","        F = np.zeros(ndof)\n","\n","        # ---- aerodynamic loads ----\n","        if F_ext is not None:\n","            if F_ext.shape[0] != ndof:\n","                print(\"  Warning: aero load size mismatch, ignoring aero for this solve.\")\n","            else:\n","                F += F_ext\n","\n","        # ---- boundary conditions via penalty method ----\n","        pen = 1e15\n","        ur = info[\"idx_upper_root\"]\n","        lr = info[\"idx_lower_root\"]\n","\n","        # Upper root fully fixed\n","        du = 3 * ur\n","        K[du, du] += pen\n","        K[du + 1, du + 1] += pen\n","        K[du + 2, du + 2] += pen\n","\n","        # Lower root: prescribed horizontal actuator displacement\n","        dl = 3 * lr\n","        K[dl, dl] += pen\n","        F[dl] += pen * actuator_disp\n","        K[dl + 1, dl + 1] += pen\n","        K[dl + 2, dl + 2] += pen\n","\n","        # ---- solve Ku = F ----\n","        try:\n","            u = spla.spsolve(K, F)\n","        except Exception as e:\n","            print(\"  solve() failed:\", e)\n","            return None, 1e12\n","\n","        # ---- post-process: max stress over all elements ----\n","        sigma_max = 0.0\n","        for i, el in enumerate(elems):\n","            n1, n2 = int(el[0]), int(el[1])\n","            u_vec = np.array([\n","                u[3 * n1],     u[3 * n1 + 1],     u[3 * n1 + 2],\n","                u[3 * n2],     u[3 * n2 + 1],     u[3 * n2 + 2],\n","            ])\n","            s = self.get_stress(nodes[n1], nodes[n2], t_elems[i], u_vec)\n","            if s > sigma_max:\n","                sigma_max = s\n","\n","        return u, sigma_max\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 4. XFOIL FLAP SHAPES + Cp AND SHAPE ERROR\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def _find_cp_col_after(df, x_col_name):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Given the column name for 'Cp(x) and P(x) upper/lower (sorted)',\n","    find the neighboring column whose first row is 'Cp'.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    cols = df.columns\n","    base = cols.get_loc(x_col_name)\n","    for j in range(1, 5):\n","        if base + j >= len(cols):\n","            break\n","        cand = cols[base + j]\n","        if str(df[cand].iloc[0]).strip().lower() == \"cp\":\n","            return cand\n","    raise RuntimeError(f\"Could not find Cp column after '{x_col_name}'\")\n","\n","\n","def load_flap_shape_and_cp(path, sheet_name):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Reads an Excel flap file (your new Mode 1/2 files) and returns:\n","\n","      fu, fl     : Akima interpolators for upper / lower target shapes y(x)\n","      fcpu, fcpl : Akima interpolators for upper / lower Cp(x)\n","\n","    All x are in physical units [m], restricted to morphing region MORPH_START→1.0c.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    df = pd.read_excel(path, sheet_name=sheet_name)\n","\n","    # Geometry: lower/upper surfaces (sorted)\n","    x_l = pd.to_numeric(df[\"Lower Surface (sorted)\"], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","    y_l = pd.to_numeric(\n","        df[df.columns[df.columns.get_loc(\"Lower Surface (sorted)\") + 1]],\n","        errors=\"coerce\"\n","    ).to_numpy()\n","    x_u = pd.to_numeric(df[\"Upper surface (sorted)\"], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","    y_u = pd.to_numeric(\n","        df[df.columns[df.columns.get_loc(\"Upper surface (sorted)\") + 1]],\n","        errors=\"coerce\"\n","    ).to_numpy()\n","\n","    # Remove NaNs\n","    mask_l = np.isfinite(x_l) & np.isfinite(y_l)\n","    mask_u = np.isfinite(x_u) & np.isfinite(y_u)\n","    x_l, y_l = x_l[mask_l], y_l[mask_l]\n","    x_u, y_u = x_u[mask_u], y_u[mask_u]\n","\n","    # Convert to physical coordinates (x/c in file → x in meters)\n","    x_l *= Config.CHORD\n","    y_l *= Config.CHORD\n","    x_u *= Config.CHORD\n","    y_u *= Config.CHORD\n","\n","    # Restrict to morphing region\n","    x_min = Config.MORPH_START * Config.CHORD\n","    x_max = Config.CHORD\n","    mask_l = (x_l >= x_min) & (x_l <= x_max)\n","    mask_u = (x_u >= x_min) & (x_u <= x_max)\n","    x_l, y_l = x_l[mask_l], y_l[mask_l]\n","    x_u, y_u = x_u[mask_u], y_u[mask_u]\n","\n","    fu = Akima1DInterpolator(x_u, y_u)  # target upper\n","    fl = Akima1DInterpolator(x_l, y_l)  # target lower\n","\n","    # ---- Cp(x) upper/lower (sorted) ----\n","    x_cp_u_col = \"Cp(x) and P(x) upper (sorted)\"\n","    x_cp_l_col = \"Cp(x) and P(x) lower (sorted)\"\n","\n","    cp_u_col = _find_cp_col_after(df, x_cp_u_col)\n","    cp_l_col = _find_cp_col_after(df, x_cp_l_col)\n","\n","    x_cp_u = pd.to_numeric(df[x_cp_u_col], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","    cp_u = pd.to_numeric(df[cp_u_col], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","    x_cp_l = pd.to_numeric(df[x_cp_l_col], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","    cp_l = pd.to_numeric(df[cp_l_col], errors=\"coerce\").to_numpy()\n","\n","    mask_cu = np.isfinite(x_cp_u) & np.isfinite(cp_u)\n","    mask_cl = np.isfinite(x_cp_l) & np.isfinite(cp_l)\n","    x_cp_u, cp_u = x_cp_u[mask_cu], cp_u[mask_cu]\n","    x_cp_l, cp_l = x_cp_l[mask_cl], cp_l[mask_cl]\n","\n","    x_cp_u *= Config.CHORD\n","    x_cp_l *= Config.CHORD\n","\n","    mask_cu = (x_cp_u >= x_min) & (x_cp_u <= x_max)\n","    mask_cl = (x_cp_l >= x_min) & (x_cp_l <= x_max)\n","    x_cp_u, cp_u = x_cp_u[mask_cu], cp_u[mask_cu]\n","    x_cp_l, cp_l = x_cp_l[mask_cl], cp_l[mask_cl]\n","\n","    fcpu = Akima1DInterpolator(x_cp_u, cp_u)\n","    fcpl = Akima1DInterpolator(x_cp_l, cp_l)\n","\n","    return fu, fl, fcpu, fcpl\n","\n","\n","def compute_shape_error(nodes, u, info, fu, fl):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Shape error J = area between deformed inner strips and\n","    the target flap shapes (upper + lower), over the morphing region.\n","\n","    Robust version: sample a fixed x-grid in the morphing region and\n","    integrate |y_def - y_target|, while aggressively avoiding NaNs.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    N = info[\"N_nodes_chord\"]\n","\n","    # Deformed node positions\n","    def_nodes = nodes.copy()\n","    def_nodes[:, 0] += u[0::3]\n","    def_nodes[:, 1] += u[1::3]\n","\n","    # Upper and lower inner strips (first N and next N nodes)\n","    xu = def_nodes[:N, 0]\n","    yu = def_nodes[:N, 1]\n","    xl = def_nodes[N:2 * N, 0]\n","    yl = def_nodes[N:2 * N, 1]\n","\n","    # Sort by x\n","    su = np.argsort(xu)\n","    sl = np.argsort(xl)\n","    xu, yu = xu[su], yu[su]\n","    xl, yl = xl[sl], yl[sl]\n","\n","    # Fixed x-grid in morphing region\n","    x_min = Config.MORPH_START * Config.CHORD\n","    x_max = Config.CHORD\n","    x_grid = np.linspace(x_min, x_max, 200)\n","\n","    # Interpolate structural deflection onto x_grid\n","    yu_def = np.interp(x_grid, xu, yu)\n","    yl_def = np.interp(x_grid, xl, yl)\n","\n","    # Target surfaces\n","    yu_tar = fu(x_grid)\n","    yl_tar = fl(x_grid)\n","\n","    # Stack and remove any NaN/Inf\n","    arr = np.stack([yu_def, yl_def, yu_tar, yl_tar], axis=-1)\n","    mask = np.all(np.isfinite(arr), axis=-1)\n","\n","    if mask.sum() < 10:\n","        return 1e6\n","\n","    x_valid = x_grid[mask]\n","    yu_def_v = yu_def[mask]\n","    yl_def_v = yl_def[mask]\n","    yu_tar_v = yu_tar[mask]\n","    yl_tar_v = yl_tar[mask]\n","\n","    err_u = trapezoid(np.abs(yu_def_v - yu_tar_v), x_valid)\n","    err_l = trapezoid(np.abs(yl_def_v - yl_tar_v), x_valid)\n","\n","    J = float(err_u + err_l)\n","    if not np.isfinite(J):\n","        return 1e6\n","    return J\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 5. NEURAL NETWORK SURROGATE\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","class SurrogateModel(nn.Module):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Very small MLP surrogate:\n","\n","        input  : [t_norm, rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param]  (5 dims)\n","        output : [J_shape_total, sigma_max]                                 (2 dims)\n","    \"\"\"\n","\n","    def __init__(self, input_dim=5):\n","        super().__init__()\n","        self.net = nn.Sequential(\n","            nn.Linear(input_dim, 32),\n","            nn.Tanh(),\n","            nn.Linear(32, 32),\n","            nn.Tanh(),\n","            nn.Linear(32, 2),\n","        )\n","\n","    def forward(self, x):\n","        return self.net(x)\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 6. LATIN HYPERCUBE SAMPLING\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def lhs(n_samples, dim, seed=0):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Simple Latin Hypercube Sampling in [0,1]^dim.\n","    Returns an (n_samples, dim) array.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    rng = np.random.RandomState(seed)\n","    cut = np.linspace(0, 1, n_samples + 1)\n","\n","    u = rng.rand(n_samples, dim)\n","    a = cut[:n_samples]\n","    b = cut[1:n_samples + 1]\n","    rdpoints = u * (b - a)[:, None] + a[:, None]\n","\n","    H = np.zeros_like(rdpoints)\n","    for j in range(dim):\n","        order = rng.permutation(n_samples)\n","        H[:, j] = rdpoints[order, 0]\n","\n","    return H\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 7. PLOTTING UTILITIES\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def plot_mode(nodes, elems, u, info, fu, fl, mode_name, color_struct=\"b\", scale=1.0):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Plot undeformed + deformed structure and target flap shape for one mode.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    N = info[\"N_nodes_chord\"]\n","\n","    def_nodes = nodes.copy()\n","    def_nodes[:, 0] += u[0::3] * scale\n","    def_nodes[:, 1] += u[1::3] * scale\n","\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4))\n","\n","    # Undeformed structure (light dashed)\n","    for (n1, n2) in elems:\n","        n1, n2 = int(n1), int(n2)\n","        plt.plot([nodes[n1, 0], nodes[n2, 0]],\n","                 [nodes[n1, 1], nodes[n2, 1]],\n","                 \"k--\", alpha=0.25)\n","\n","    # Deformed structure\n","    for (n1, n2) in elems:\n","        n1, n2 = int(n1), int(n2)\n","        plt.plot([def_nodes[n1, 0], def_nodes[n2, 0]],\n","                 [def_nodes[n1, 1], def_nodes[n2, 1]],\n","                 color_struct + \"-\", lw=1.5)\n","\n","    # Target flap upper/lower\n","    x_plot = np.linspace(Config.MORPH_START * Config.CHORD, Config.CHORD, 200)\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fu(x_plot), \"g--\", lw=1.5, label=f\"{mode_name} target upper\")\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fl(x_plot), \"m--\", lw=1.5, label=f\"{mode_name} target lower\")\n","\n","    plt.axis(\"equal\")\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.xlabel(\"Chordwise position x [m]\")\n","    plt.ylabel(\"Thickness direction y [m]\")\n","    plt.title(f\"Morphing Trailing Edge – {mode_name}\\n\"\n","              f\"(black = undeformed, {color_struct} = deformed x{scale:.1f})\")\n","    plt.legend(loc=\"best\")\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","def plot_overlay_modes(nodes, elems, u1, u2, info,\n","                       fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2, scale=5.0):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Overlay mode 1 and mode 2 deformed structures in a single plot.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    N = info[\"N_nodes_chord\"]\n","\n","    def1 = nodes.copy()\n","    def1[:, 0] += u1[0::3] * scale\n","    def1[:, 1] += u1[1::3] * scale\n","\n","    def2 = nodes.copy()\n","    def2[:, 0] += u2[0::3] * scale\n","    def2[:, 1] += u2[1::3] * scale\n","\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4))\n","\n","    # Undeformed\n","    for (n1, n2) in elems:\n","        n1, n2 = int(n1), int(n2)\n","        plt.plot([nodes[n1, 0], nodes[n2, 0]],\n","                 [nodes[n1, 1], nodes[n2, 1]],\n","                 \"k--\", alpha=0.15)\n","\n","    # Mode 1\n","    for (n1, n2) in elems:\n","        n1, n2 = int(n1), int(n2)\n","        plt.plot([def1[n1, 0], def1[n2, 0]],\n","                 [def1[n1, 1], def1[n2, 1]],\n","                 \"b-\", lw=1.2, alpha=0.9)\n","\n","    # Mode 2\n","    for (n1, n2) in elems:\n","        n1, n2 = int(n1), int(n2)\n","        plt.plot([def2[n1, 0], def2[n2, 0]],\n","                 [def2[n1, 1], def2[n2, 1]],\n","                 \"r-\", lw=1.2, alpha=0.9)\n","\n","    # Targets\n","    x_plot = np.linspace(Config.MORPH_START * Config.CHORD, Config.CHORD, 200)\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fu1(x_plot), \"c--\", lw=1.2, label=\"Mode 1 target upper (-1°)\")\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fl1(x_plot), \"c:\",  lw=1.2, label=\"Mode 1 target lower (-1°)\")\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fu2(x_plot), \"y--\", lw=1.2, label=\"Mode 2 target upper (-5°)\")\n","    plt.plot(x_plot, fl2(x_plot), \"y:\",  lw=1.2, label=\"Mode 2 target lower (-5°)\")\n","\n","    plt.axis(\"equal\")\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.xlabel(\"Chordwise position x [m]\")\n","    plt.ylabel(\"Thickness direction y [m]\")\n","    plt.title(f\"Morphing Trailing Edge – Overlay of Mode 1 and Mode 2\\n\"\n","              f\"(deformation scaled by {scale:.1f}×)\")\n","    plt.legend(loc=\"best\", fontsize=8)\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","def plot_loss_curve(loss_history):\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(6, 4))\n","    plt.plot(loss_history, \"-\")\n","    plt.xlabel(\"Epoch\")\n","    plt.ylabel(\"Training MSE loss\")\n","    plt.title(\"Surrogate NN training loss\")\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","def plot_parity(y_true, y_pred, title, xlabel, ylabel):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Simple parity plot: predicted vs true.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(5, 5))\n","    y_true = np.asarray(y_true)\n","    y_pred = np.asarray(y_pred)\n","\n","    plt.scatter(y_true, y_pred, s=10, alpha=0.5)\n","    lims = [\n","        min(np.min(y_true), np.min(y_pred)),\n","        max(np.max(y_true), np.max(y_pred)),\n","    ]\n","    plt.plot(lims, lims, \"k--\", lw=1.0)\n","    plt.xlim(lims)\n","    plt.ylim(lims)\n","    plt.xlabel(xlabel)\n","    plt.ylabel(ylabel)\n","    plt.title(title)\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 8. ACTUATOR CALIBRATION\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def find_best_actuator_disp_with_aero(geo, fem, fu, fl, fcpu, fcpl, q_inf,\n","                                      t_skin,\n","                                      rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param,\n","                                      u_min, u_max, n_u=60):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    1D search over actuator displacement for a fixed structural design,\n","    BUT with Cp-based aero loads applied during calibration.\n","\n","    u_min, u_max are already scaled to the current chord.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    # Build mesh for this baseline design\n","    nodes, elems, t_elems, info = geo.generate_mesh(\n","        t_skin,\n","        rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param\n","    )\n","\n","    # Build aero loads for this mode\n","    F_aero = fem.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu, fcpl, q_inf)\n","\n","    u_candidates = np.linspace(u_min, u_max, n_u)\n","    best_J = np.inf\n","    best_u = None\n","\n","    for u_act in u_candidates:\n","        u, _ = fem.solve(\n","            nodes, elems, t_elems,\n","            actuator_disp=u_act,\n","            info=info,\n","            F_ext=F_aero\n","        )\n","        if u is None:\n","            continue\n","\n","        J = compute_shape_error(nodes, u, info, fu, fl)\n","        if np.isfinite(J) and (J < best_J):\n","            best_J = J\n","            best_u = u_act\n","\n","    return best_u, best_J\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 9. DATASET GENERATION (with or without aero)\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def generate_dataset(geo, fem, fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2, fcpu1, fcpl1, fcpu2, fcpl2,\n","                     use_aero=True, n_samples=100):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Generate dataset using Latin Hypercube Sampling.\n","\n","    Design variables:\n","        t_norm, rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param ∈ [0,1]\n","\n","    If use_aero=False: only actuator loading (old behavior).\n","    If use_aero=True : actuator + Cp-based aero loads.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    input_dim = 5\n","    samples = lhs(n_samples, input_dim, seed=0)\n","    t_min, t_max = Config.get_thickness_bounds()\n","\n","    X_list = []\n","    Y_list = []\n","\n","    if use_aero:\n","        q1 = Config.q_mode1()\n","        q2 = Config.q_mode2()\n","\n","    print(f\"\\n=== 3. Generating FEM dataset (LHS, UNIFORM thickness, \"\n","          f\"{'with aero' if use_aero else 'actuator only'}) ===\")\n","\n","    for i in range(n_samples):\n","        t_norm, rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param = samples[i]\n","\n","        # Map normalized thickness to physical [t_min, t_max]\n","        t_skin = t_min + (t_max - t_min) * t_norm\n","\n","        # Build mesh for this design\n","        nodes, elems, t_elems, info = geo.generate_mesh(\n","            t_skin,\n","            rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param\n","        )\n","\n","        # Build aero loads if needed\n","        F_aero1 = None\n","        F_aero2 = None\n","        if use_aero:\n","            F_aero1 = fem.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu1, fcpl1, q1)\n","            F_aero2 = fem.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu2, fcpl2, q2)\n","\n","        try:\n","            # ---- Mode 1 ----\n","            u1, sigma1 = fem.solve(\n","                nodes, elems, t_elems,\n","                actuator_disp=Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1,\n","                info=info,\n","                F_ext=F_aero1\n","            )\n","            if u1 is None:\n","                continue\n","            J1 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u1, info, fu1, fl1)\n","\n","            # ---- Mode 2 ----\n","            u2, sigma2 = fem.solve(\n","                nodes, elems, t_elems,\n","                actuator_disp=Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2,\n","                info=info,\n","                F_ext=F_aero2\n","            )\n","            if u2 is None:\n","                continue\n","            J2 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u2, info, fu2, fl2)\n","\n","        except Exception as e:\n","            print(f\"  Sample {i+1:3d} skipped due to error: {e}\")\n","            continue\n","\n","        if not (np.isfinite(J1) and np.isfinite(J2)):\n","            continue\n","\n","        Jtot = J1 + J2\n","        sigma_max = max(sigma1, sigma2)\n","\n","        X_list.append([t_norm, rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param])\n","        Y_list.append([Jtot, sigma_max])\n","\n","        if (i + 1) % 25 == 0:\n","            print(\n","                f\" Sample {i+1:3d} | \"\n","                f\"J1={J1:.4e}, J2={J2:.4e}, \"\n","                f\"sigma_max={sigma_max/1e6:6.2f} MPa\"\n","            )\n","\n","    X_raw = np.array(X_list, dtype=np.float32)\n","    Y_raw = np.array(Y_list, dtype=np.float32)\n","\n","    print(f\"\\nCollected {X_raw.shape[0]} valid samples out of {n_samples} attempts.\")\n","    return X_raw, Y_raw\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 10. TRUE FEM EVALUATION FOR A GIVEN DESIGN (DIAGNOSTIC)\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def evaluate_design_FEM(t_norm,\n","                        rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param,\n","                        geo, fem,\n","                        fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2,\n","                        fcpu1, fcpl1, fcpu2, fcpl2,\n","                        use_aero=True):\n","    \"\"\"\n","    Evaluate the *true* FEM for a single design:\n","\n","        inputs  : t_norm in [0,1], rib*_param in [0,1]\n","        outputs : (Jtot, J1, J2, sigma_max)\n","\n","    This bypasses the surrogate entirely.\n","    \"\"\"\n","    # Map normalized thickness to physical\n","    t_min, t_max = Config.get_thickness_bounds()\n","    t_skin = t_min + (t_max - t_min) * t_norm\n","\n","    # Build mesh\n","    nodes, elems, t_elems, info = geo.generate_mesh(\n","        t_skin,\n","        rib1_param, rib2_param, rib3_param, rib4_param\n","    )\n","\n","    # Optional aero loads\n","    if use_aero:\n","        q1 = Config.q_mode1()\n","        q2 = Config.q_mode2()\n","        F_aero1 = fem.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu1, fcpl1, q1)\n","        F_aero2 = fem.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu2, fcpl2, q2)\n","    else:\n","        F_aero1 = None\n","        F_aero2 = None\n","\n","    # Mode 1\n","    u1, sigma1 = fem.solve(\n","        nodes, elems, t_elems,\n","        actuator_disp=Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1,\n","        info=info,\n","        F_ext=F_aero1\n","    )\n","    if u1 is None:\n","        return np.nan, np.nan, np.nan, np.nan\n","\n","    J1 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u1, info, fu1, fl1)\n","\n","    # Mode 2\n","    u2, sigma2 = fem.solve(\n","        nodes, elems, t_elems,\n","        actuator_disp=Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2,\n","        info=info,\n","        F_ext=F_aero2\n","    )\n","    if u2 is None:\n","        return np.nan, np.nan, np.nan, np.nan\n","\n","    J2 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u2, info, fu2, fl2)\n","\n","    Jtot = J1 + J2\n","    sigma_max = max(sigma1, sigma2)\n","\n","    return float(Jtot), float(J1), float(J2), float(sigma_max)\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 11. MAIN OPTIMIZATION PIPELINE\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","def run_optimization():\n","    np.random.seed(0)\n","    torch.manual_seed(0)\n","\n","    # Initialize scaled actuator defaults before anything else\n","    Config.init_scaled_defaults()\n","\n","    print(\"=== 1. Geometry & FEM Setup ===\")\n","    geo = WingGeometry()\n","    fem = FEMSolver()\n","\n","    print(\"\\n=== 2. Loading flap target shapes + Cp from XFOIL ===\")\n","    fu1, fl1, fcpu1, fcpl1 = load_flap_shape_and_cp(\n","        Config.FLAP_PATH_MODE1, Config.FLAP_SHEET_MODE1\n","    )\n","    fu2, fl2, fcpu2, fcpl2 = load_flap_shape_and_cp(\n","        Config.FLAP_PATH_MODE2, Config.FLAP_SHEET_MODE2\n","    )\n","    print(\"  Loaded Mode 1 (-1°) and Mode 2 (-5°) flap shapes + Cp.\")\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 2a. Actuator stroke calibration (WITH aero loads, properly scaled)\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    print(\"\\n=== 2a. Calibrating actuator strokes from XFOIL flap shapes (with aero) ===\")\n","    t_min, t_max = Config.get_thickness_bounds()\n","    t_skin_cal = 0.5 * (t_min + t_max)   # mid thickness\n","\n","    # mid in [0,1] for all ribs\n","    rib1_cal = 0.5\n","    rib2_cal = 0.5\n","    rib3_cal = 0.5\n","    rib4_cal = 0.5\n","\n","    q1 = Config.q_mode1()\n","    q2 = Config.q_mode2()\n","\n","    # Scaled search ranges\n","    u1_min, u1_max, u2_min, u2_max = Config.get_actuator_search_ranges()\n","\n","    # Mode 1 (−1°)\n","    u1_star, J1_star = find_best_actuator_disp_with_aero(\n","        geo, fem, fu1, fl1, fcpu1, fcpl1, q1,\n","        t_skin_cal,\n","        rib1_cal, rib2_cal, rib3_cal, rib4_cal,\n","        u_min=u1_min, u_max=u1_max, n_u=60\n","    )\n","\n","    # Mode 2 (−5°)\n","    u2_star, J2_star = find_best_actuator_disp_with_aero(\n","        geo, fem, fu2, fl2, fcpu2, fcpl2, q2,\n","        t_skin_cal,\n","        rib1_cal, rib2_cal, rib3_cal, rib4_cal,\n","        u_min=u2_min, u_max=u2_max, n_u=80\n","    )\n","\n","    if (u1_star is None) or (u2_star is None):\n","        print(\"  WARNING: actuator calibration failed; using scaled default strokes.\")\n","    else:\n","        Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1 = float(u1_star)\n","        Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2 = float(u2_star)\n","        print(f\"  Calibrated actuator strokes (with aero):\")\n","        print(f\"    Mode 1 (−1°): u_act ≈ {Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1*1e3:.2f} mm \"\n","              f\"(J_shape ≈ {J1_star:.4e})\")\n","        print(f\"    Mode 2 (−5°): u_act ≈ {Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2*1e3:.2f} mm \"\n","              f\"(J_shape ≈ {J2_star:.4e})\")\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 3. Dataset generation\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    X_raw, Y_raw = generate_dataset(\n","        geo, fem, fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2, fcpu1, fcpl1, fcpu2, fcpl2,\n","        use_aero=True, n_samples=500\n","    )\n","\n","    # If aero completely breaks dataset, fall back to actuator-only\n","    if X_raw.shape[0] == 0:\n","        print(\"\\nNo valid samples with aero loads – falling back to actuator-only dataset.\")\n","        X_raw, Y_raw = generate_dataset(\n","            geo, fem, fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2, fcpu1, fcpl1, fcpu2, fcpl2,\n","            use_aero=False, n_samples=100 # sample size of 125 and larger showed\n","                                          # overfitting and global learning instead of\n","                                          # local smoothness, MLP too small and FEM is too nonlinear\n","        )\n","        use_aero_for_validation = False\n","    else:\n","        use_aero_for_validation = True\n","\n","    t_min, t_max = Config.get_thickness_bounds()\n","\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 4. Train neural network surrogate (with train/test split)\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    print(\"\\n=== 4. Training surrogate NN ===\")\n","\n","    # 80/20 split\n","    N = X_raw.shape[0]\n","    perm = np.random.permutation(N)\n","    n_train = int(0.8 * N)\n","    train_idx = perm[:n_train]\n","    test_idx = perm[n_train:]\n","\n","    X_train_np = X_raw[train_idx]\n","    Y_train_np = Y_raw[train_idx]\n","    X_test_np = X_raw[test_idx]\n","    Y_test_np = Y_raw[test_idx]\n","\n","    X_train = torch.tensor(X_train_np, dtype=torch.float32)\n","    Y_train = torch.tensor(Y_train_np, dtype=torch.float32)\n","    X_test = torch.tensor(X_test_np, dtype=torch.float32)\n","    Y_test = torch.tensor(Y_test_np, dtype=torch.float32)\n","\n","    # normalize outputs using TRAIN stats only\n","    y_mean = Y_train.mean(0)\n","    y_std = Y_train.std(0) + 1e-6\n","    Y_train_norm = (Y_train - y_mean) / y_std\n","\n","    model = SurrogateModel(input_dim=5)\n","    opt = optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=5e-3)\n","    loss_fn = nn.MSELoss()\n","\n","    n_epochs = 1000\n","    loss_history = []\n","\n","    for epoch in range(n_epochs):\n","        opt.zero_grad()\n","        pred_train = model(X_train)\n","        loss = loss_fn(pred_train, Y_train_norm)\n","        loss.backward()\n","        opt.step()\n","\n","        loss_history.append(loss.item())\n","\n","        if epoch % 150 == 0 or epoch == n_epochs - 1:\n","            print(f\"  Epoch {epoch:4d}, loss = {loss.item():.3e}\")\n","\n","    # Plot training loss curve\n","    plot_loss_curve(loss_history)\n","\n","    # ---- surrogate metrics on train/test (de-normalized) ----\n","    with torch.no_grad():\n","        pred_train_norm = model(X_train)\n","        pred_test_norm = model(X_test)\n","\n","        pred_train = pred_train_norm * y_std + y_mean\n","        pred_test = pred_test_norm * y_std + y_mean\n","\n","    Y_train_true = Y_train_np\n","    Y_test_true = Y_test_np\n","    Y_train_pred = pred_train.cpu().numpy()\n","    Y_test_pred = pred_test.cpu().numpy()\n","\n","    def compute_metrics(y_true, y_pred, name):\n","        y_true = np.asarray(y_true)\n","        y_pred = np.asarray(y_pred)\n","        mse = np.mean((y_true - y_pred) ** 2, axis=0)\n","        rmse = np.sqrt(mse)\n","        # R^2 for each output\n","        r2 = 1.0 - np.sum((y_true - y_pred) ** 2, axis=0) / np.sum(\n","            (y_true - y_true.mean(axis=0)) ** 2, axis=0\n","        )\n","        print(f\"\\n{name} RMSE:\")\n","        print(f\"  J_shape   : {rmse[0]:.4e}\")\n","        print(f\"  sigma_max : {rmse[1]/1e6:.3f} MPa\")\n","        print(f\"{name} R^2:\")\n","        print(f\"  J_shape   : {r2[0]:.4f}\")\n","        print(f\"  sigma_max : {r2[1]:.4f}\")\n","\n","    compute_metrics(Y_train_true, Y_train_pred, \"TRAIN\")\n","    compute_metrics(Y_test_true, Y_test_pred, \"TEST\")\n","\n","    # Parity plots\n","    plot_parity(\n","        Y_train_true[:, 0],\n","        Y_train_pred[:, 0],\n","        \"Parity plot – J_shape (train)\",\n","        \"True J_shape\",\n","        \"Pred J_shape\",\n","    )\n","    plot_parity(\n","        Y_test_true[:, 0],\n","        Y_test_pred[:, 0],\n","        \"Parity plot – J_shape (test)\",\n","        \"True J_shape\",\n","        \"Pred J_shape\",\n","    )\n","\n","    plot_parity(\n","        Y_train_true[:, 1],\n","        Y_train_pred[:, 1],\n","        \"Parity plot – sigma_max (train)\",\n","        \"True sigma_max [Pa]\",\n","        \"Pred sigma_max [Pa]\",\n","    )\n","    plot_parity(\n","        Y_test_true[:, 1],\n","        Y_test_pred[:, 1],\n","        \"Parity plot – sigma_max (test)\",\n","        \"True sigma_max [Pa]\",\n","        \"Pred sigma_max [Pa]\",\n","    )\n","\n","    # store tensors & stats for later optimization\n","    y_mean_t = y_mean.detach()\n","    y_std_t = y_std.detach()\n","\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 5. Gradient-based optimization on surrogate (multi-start + spacing penalty)\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    print(\"\\n=== 5. Gradient-based design optimization (UNIFORM thickness) ===\")\n","\n","    # Hyperparameters for penalties\n","\n","    # EXPLAIN IN PRES. DIFFERENT TESTING OF PENALTY WEIGHTS WITH NEGLIGIBLE EFFECTS\n","    # non dimensional stress penalty\n","    # sigma consistently below yield stress, penalty effectively negligible\n","    # made 0 for clarity, still part of the larger optimizer math\n","    wsigma = 0      # stress > yield penalty weight\n","\n","    # thickness penalty to encourage thin designs, already normalized to 1\n","    # empirically determined to be negligible, surrogate model converges to same t\n","    # that falls nicely within our defined range, no penalty needed\n","    # made 0 for clarity, still part of the larger optimizer math\n","    wt = 0           # thickness penalty weight\n","\n","    wspace = 1e-3      # rib spacing penalty weight\n","\n","    delta_space = 0.02 # spacing length scale in chord fraction\n","\n","    def surrogate_objective(x_param):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        x_param: tensor of shape (5,) in [0,1]^5\n","        returns scalar J (PyTorch tensor)\n","        \"\"\"\n","        out_norm = model(x_param.unsqueeze(0))\n","        out_phys = out_norm * y_std_t + y_mean_t  # un-normalize\n","\n","        Jshape_pred = out_phys[0, 0]\n","        sigma_pred = out_phys[0, 1]\n","        sigma_nd = sigma_pred / Config.YIELD_STRESS\n","\n","        # stress penalty (dimensionless)\n","        stress_violation = torch.relu(sigma_nd - 1.0)\n","\n","        # thickness penalty (t_norm = x[0])\n","        t_norm = x_param[0]\n","        t_penalty = t_norm\n","\n","        # spacing penalty\n","        rib_params = x_param[1:]  # r1..r4\n","        rib_fracs = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib_params\n","        J_space = 0.0\n","        for i in range(4):\n","            for j in range(i + 1, 4):\n","                J_space = J_space + torch.exp(\n","                    -torch.abs(rib_fracs[i] - rib_fracs[j]) / delta_space\n","                )\n","\n","        J = Jshape_pred + wsigma * stress_violation + wt * t_penalty + wspace * J_space\n","        return J, Jshape_pred, sigma_pred\n","\n","    n_steps = 1000\n","    n_restarts = 5\n","\n","    best_global_x = None\n","    best_global_J = float(\"inf\")\n","\n","    for r in range(n_restarts):\n","        if r == 0:\n","            # restart 0: mean of training designs\n","            x0 = X_train.mean(0).clone().detach()\n","        else:\n","            # other restarts: random in [0,1]^5\n","            x0 = torch.rand(5)\n","\n","        x0.requires_grad_(True)\n","        opt_x = optim.Adam([x0], lr=0.02)\n","\n","        for step in range(n_steps):\n","            opt_x.zero_grad()\n","            J, Jshape_pred, sigma_pred = surrogate_objective(x0)\n","            J.backward()\n","            opt_x.step()\n","\n","            with torch.no_grad():\n","                x0.clamp_(0.0, 1.0)\n","\n","            if (r == 0) and (step % 50 == 0 or step == n_steps - 1):\n","                print(\n","                    f\"  [restart 0] Step {step:3d} | \"\n","                    f\"Jshape={Jshape_pred.item():.4e}, \"\n","                    f\"sigma={sigma_pred.item()/1e6:6.2f} MPa\"\n","                )\n","\n","        # evaluate final J for this restart\n","        with torch.no_grad():\n","            J_final, _, _ = surrogate_objective(x0)\n","\n","        if J_final.item() < best_global_J:\n","            best_global_J = J_final.item()\n","            best_global_x = x0.detach().clone()\n","\n","    print(f\"\\n  Best surrogate J after {n_restarts} restarts: {best_global_J:.4e}\")\n","\n","    # ----- small FEM-based refinement around best_global_x -----\n","    def evaluate_true_objective(x_vec_np):\n","        \"\"\"\n","        x_vec_np: numpy array of shape (5,) in [0,1]^5\n","        returns (J_total, Jshape, sigma_max)\n","        \"\"\"\n","        x_vec_np = np.clip(np.asarray(x_vec_np, dtype=float), 0.0, 1.0)\n","        t_norm, r1, r2, r3, r4 = x_vec_np\n","        t_skin = t_min + (t_max - t_min) * t_norm\n","\n","        nodes_loc, elems_loc, t_elems_loc, info_loc = geo.generate_mesh(\n","            t_skin, r1, r2, r3, r4\n","        )\n","\n","        if use_aero_for_validation:\n","            q1 = Config.q_mode1()\n","            q2 = Config.q_mode2()\n","            F_aero1_loc = fem.build_aero_load_vector(\n","                nodes_loc, info_loc, fcpu1, fcpl1, q1\n","            )\n","            F_aero2_loc = fem.build_aero_load_vector(\n","                nodes_loc, info_loc, fcpu2, fcpl2, q2\n","            )\n","        else:\n","            F_aero1_loc = None\n","            F_aero2_loc = None\n","\n","        # Mode 1\n","        u1_loc, sigma1_loc = fem.solve(\n","            nodes_loc, elems_loc, t_elems_loc,\n","            Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1, info_loc, F_ext=F_aero1_loc\n","        )\n","        J1_loc = compute_shape_error(nodes_loc, u1_loc, info_loc, fu1, fl1)\n","\n","        # Mode 2\n","        u2_loc, sigma2_loc = fem.solve(\n","            nodes_loc, elems_loc, t_elems_loc,\n","            Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2, info_loc, F_ext=F_aero2_loc\n","        )\n","        J2_loc = compute_shape_error(nodes_loc, u2_loc, info_loc, fu2, fl2)\n","\n","        Jshape_loc = J1_loc + J2_loc\n","        sigma_max_loc = max(sigma1_loc, sigma2_loc)\n","\n","        sigma_nd_loc = sigma_max_loc / Config.YIELD_STRESS\n","        stress_violation_loc = max(0.0, sigma_nd_loc - 1.0)\n","        t_penalty_loc = t_norm\n","\n","        # spacing penalty (same form as surrogate)\n","        rib_fracs_np = 0.75 + 0.20 * np.array([r1, r2, r3, r4])\n","        J_space_np = 0.0\n","        for i in range(4):\n","            for j in range(i + 1, 4):\n","                J_space_np += np.exp(-abs(rib_fracs_np[i] - rib_fracs_np[j]) / delta_space)\n","\n","        J_total_loc = (\n","            Jshape_loc\n","            + wsigma * stress_violation_loc\n","            + wt * t_penalty_loc\n","            + wspace * J_space_np\n","        )\n","        return J_total_loc, Jshape_loc, sigma_max_loc\n","\n","    best_x_np = best_global_x.cpu().numpy()\n","    best_J_true, best_Jshape_true, best_sigma_true = evaluate_true_objective(best_x_np)\n","\n","    print(\n","        f\"  FEM refinement start: J_true={best_J_true:.4e}, \"\n","        f\"Jshape={best_Jshape_true:.4e}, \"\n","        f\"sigma_max={best_sigma_true/1e6:6.2f} MPa\"\n","    )\n","\n","    delta_local = 0.03  # step in design space (0–1)\n","    for it in range(2):  # a couple of sweeps\n","        improved = False\n","        for j in range(5):\n","            for step in (-delta_local, delta_local):\n","                cand = best_x_np.copy()\n","                cand[j] = np.clip(cand[j] + step, 0.0, 1.0)\n","                J_cand, Jshape_cand, sigma_cand = evaluate_true_objective(cand)\n","                if J_cand < best_J_true:\n","                    best_J_true = J_cand\n","                    best_Jshape_true = Jshape_cand\n","                    best_sigma_true = sigma_cand\n","                    best_x_np = cand\n","                    improved = True\n","        if not improved:\n","            break\n","\n","    print(\n","        f\"  FEM refinement end  : J_true={best_J_true:.4e}, \"\n","        f\"Jshape={best_Jshape_true:.4e}, \"\n","        f\"sigma_max={best_sigma_true/1e6:6.2f} MPa\"\n","    )\n","\n","    # Convert refined best design back to torch tensor for decoding/plots\n","    best_x = torch.tensor(best_x_np, dtype=torch.float32)\n","\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 6. Decode optimal design and validate with FEM\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    best = best_x.detach().cpu().numpy()\n","    t_norm_opt, rib1_opt, rib2_opt, rib3_opt, rib4_opt = best\n","    t_skin_opt = t_min + (t_max - t_min) * t_norm_opt\n","\n","    # Map rib params → chord fractions (same as in WingGeometry)\n","    rib1_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib1_opt   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","    rib2_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib2_opt   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","    rib3_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib3_opt   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","    rib4_frac = 0.75 + 0.20 * rib4_opt   # 0.75c → 0.95c\n","\n","    print(f\"\\nUniform flex-strip thickness (skin) ≈ {t_skin_opt*1e3:.3f} mm\")\n","    print(\"Rib locations (as % chord):\")\n","    print(f\"  Rib 1 @ {rib1_frac*100:.1f}% c\")\n","    print(f\"  Rib 2 @ {rib2_frac*100:.1f}% c\")\n","    print(f\"  Rib 3 @ {rib3_frac*100:.1f}% c\")\n","    print(f\"  Rib 4 @ {rib4_frac*100:.1f}% c\")\n","\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    # 6. THICKNESS SWEEP AT FIXED OPTIMAL RIBS (TRUE FEM DIAGNOSTIC)\n","    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n","    print(\"\\n=== 6. Thickness sweep at fixed optimal rib locations (true FEM) ===\")\n","\n","    # Sweep normalized thickness between 0 and 1\n","    t_norm_vals = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, 100)  # 25 points across the range\n","    Jtot_vals = []\n","    sigma_vals = []\n","\n","    for t_norm_sweep in t_norm_vals:\n","        Jtot, J1_s, J2_s, sigma_max_s = evaluate_design_FEM(\n","            t_norm_sweep,\n","            rib1_opt, rib2_opt, rib3_opt, rib4_opt,\n","            geo, fem,\n","            fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2,\n","            fcpu1, fcpl1, fcpu2, fcpl2,\n","            use_aero=use_aero_for_validation\n","        )\n","        Jtot_vals.append(Jtot)\n","        sigma_vals.append(sigma_max_s)\n","\n","    Jtot_vals = np.array(Jtot_vals)\n","    sigma_vals = np.array(sigma_vals)\n","\n","    # Convert thickness to physical mm for plotting\n","    t_min, t_max = Config.get_thickness_bounds()\n","    t_skin_vals = t_min + (t_max - t_min) * t_norm_vals  # [m]\n","    t_skin_mm = t_skin_vals * 1e3                        # [mm]\n","\n","    # Report the best FEM thickness from the sweep\n","    valid_mask = np.isfinite(Jtot_vals)\n","    if np.any(valid_mask):\n","        idx_best = np.argmin(Jtot_vals[valid_mask])\n","        # Need to map back into full array indices\n","        full_indices = np.where(valid_mask)[0]\n","        idx_best = full_indices[idx_best]\n","\n","        print(f\"  Min J_shape (true FEM sweep) at t ≈ {t_skin_mm[idx_best]:.3f} mm \"\n","              f\"(t_norm ≈ {t_norm_vals[idx_best]:.3f}), \"\n","              f\"sigma_max ≈ {sigma_vals[idx_best]/1e6:6.2f} MPa\")\n","    else:\n","        print(\"  WARNING: all thickness sweep evaluations returned NaN J_shape.\")\n","\n","    # --- Plot Jshape vs thickness ---\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(6, 4))\n","    plt.plot(t_skin_mm, Jtot_vals, \"-o\")\n","    plt.xlabel(\"Uniform skin thickness t [mm]\")\n","    plt.ylabel(\"Combined shape error J_shape (m²)\")\n","    plt.title(\"True FEM: J_shape vs skin thickness (fixed ribs)\")\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","    # --- Plot sigma_max vs thickness ---\n","    plt.figure(figsize=(6, 4))\n","    plt.plot(t_skin_mm, sigma_vals / 1e6, \"-o\")\n","    plt.axhline(Config.YIELD_STRESS / 1e6, linestyle=\"--\", label=\"Yield stress\")\n","    plt.xlabel(\"Uniform skin thickness t [mm]\")\n","    plt.ylabel(\"Max von Mises stress [MPa]\")\n","    plt.title(\"True FEM: σ_max vs skin thickness (fixed ribs)\")\n","    plt.legend()\n","    plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n","    plt.tight_layout()\n","    plt.show()\n","\n","\n","    print(\"\\n=== 6. Full FEM validation of optimized design \"\n","          f\"(both modes, {'with aero' if use_aero_for_validation else 'actuator only'}) ===\")\n","    geo_val = geo\n","    fem_val = fem\n","    nodes, elems, t_elems, info = geo_val.generate_mesh(\n","        t_skin_opt,\n","        rib1_opt, rib2_opt, rib3_opt, rib4_opt\n","    )\n","\n","    if use_aero_for_validation:\n","        q1 = Config.q_mode1()\n","        q2 = Config.q_mode2()\n","        F_aero1 = fem_val.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu1, fcpl1, q1)\n","        F_aero2 = fem_val.build_aero_load_vector(nodes, info, fcpu2, fcpl2, q2)\n","    else:\n","        F_aero1 = None\n","        F_aero2 = None\n","\n","    # Mode 1\n","    u1, sigma1 = fem_val.solve(\n","        nodes, elems, t_elems, Config.ACTUATOR_MODE1, info, F_ext=F_aero1\n","    )\n","    J1 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u1, info, fu1, fl1)\n","\n","    # Mode 2\n","    u2, sigma2 = fem_val.solve(\n","        nodes, elems, t_elems, Config.ACTUATOR_MODE2, info, F_ext=F_aero2\n","    )\n","    J2 = compute_shape_error(nodes, u2, info, fu2, fl2)\n","\n","    print(f\"  Mode 1 (-1°):  J_shape = {J1:.4e}, sigma_max = {sigma1/1e6:6.2f} MPa\")\n","    print(f\"  Mode 2 (-5°):  J_shape = {J2:.4e}, sigma_max = {sigma2/1e6:6.2f} MPa\")\n","    print(f\"  Combined J    = {J1+J2:.4e}\")\n","    print(f\"  Max sigma     = {max(sigma1, sigma2)/1e6:6.2f} MPa \"\n","          f\"(yield {Config.YIELD_STRESS/1e6:.1f} MPa)\")\n","\n","    # ---- plots ----\n","    plot_mode(nodes, elems, u1, info, fu1, fl1,\n","              mode_name=\"Mode 1 (−1° flap)\", color_struct=\"b\", scale=1.0)\n","    plot_mode(nodes, elems, u2, info, fu2, fl2,\n","              mode_name=\"Mode 2 (−5° flap)\", color_struct=\"r\", scale=1.0)\n","    plot_overlay_modes(nodes, elems, u1, u2, info, fu1, fl1, fu2, fl2, scale=1.0)\n","\n","\n","# =============================================================================\n","# 12. MAIN\n","# =============================================================================\n","\n","if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n","    run_optimization()\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount('/content/drive')"],"metadata":{"id":"mH6ywjrJCwn3"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]}]}
